        "type": "text",
        "content": "Both proposals were approved and have now run on T-501 and order PC-1055.\n\n- **Reply:** The email to Carla went out, and the ticket is now pending.\n- **Refund:** The approver gave her 11.00 EUR in store credit for PC-1055. That is slightly more than my estimate of 10, so the approver presumably corrected it to the real price. Carla's reply promised a choice of card or store credit, but she was given store credit directly. She may expect to be offered the choice. If she asks for the card instead, that will need a new proposal.\n\nI have nothing further to propose.",
